      "start_seconds": 0.63,
      "end_seconds": 4.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Morning. Nice to finally see you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.98,
      "end_seconds": 13.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Right on time. Sit, please. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.61,
      "end_seconds": 21.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "I've been feeling overwhelmed at work, and I wanted to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.8,
      "end_seconds": 27.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Tell me what you take day to day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.7,
      "end_seconds": 31.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.15,
      "end_seconds": 35.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.76,
      "end_seconds": 40.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Probably two months. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.32,
      "end_seconds": 49.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.5,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.42,
      "end_seconds": 58.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say. Yes, deadlines. That That makes it worse. Weekends off helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.78,
      "end_seconds": 64.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "right, does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.47,
      "end_seconds": 78.24,
      "duration_seconds": 12.77,
      "text": "Trouble switching off at night goes along with it, most of the time. Yeah, uh, about Trouble switching off at night, moderate, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.37,
      "end_seconds": 85.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "Have you had any thoughts of harming myself, chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.86,
      "end_seconds": 94.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "I haven't had thoughts of harming myself, chest pain or weight loss, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.13,
      "end_seconds": 100.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "okay, and and alcohol use, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.21,
      "end_seconds": 105.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any alcohol use."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.22,
      "end_seconds": 109.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Alright, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.33,
      "end_seconds": 112.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.7,
      "end_seconds": 132.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Is there anything medical in your background?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.17,
      "end_seconds": 137.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I have acid reflux, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.64,
      "end_seconds": 142.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "right, right a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.43,
      "end_seconds": 156.76,
      "duration_seconds": 12.33,
      "text": "I go to the gym a couple of times a week. I eat out quite a lot, to be honest. Yes, I live on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.56,
      "end_seconds": 169.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.62,
      "end_seconds": 175.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.39,
      "end_seconds": 180.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.21,
      "end_seconds": 185.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Pollen. I come out in... well, sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.7,
      "end_seconds": 190.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "First the numbers, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.83,
      "end_seconds": 204.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "One second..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.67,
      "end_seconds": 232.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 71 beats a minute, blood pressure 127 over 82, temperature is 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.78,
      "end_seconds": 234.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.19,
      "end_seconds": 237.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I'll come back to those numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.08,
      "end_seconds": 255.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "So, based on your history, I think we're dealing with stress-related symptoms at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.07,
      "end_seconds": 260.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.0,
      "end_seconds": 270.44,
      "duration_seconds": 9.44,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's stress-related symptoms, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.23,
      "end_seconds": 285.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Let's book blood tests to look into stress-related symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.09,
      "end_seconds": 288.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "How long does that take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.06,
      "end_seconds": 305.67,
      "duration_seconds": 15.61,
      "text": "talking to someone, even a counsellor, helps more than people expect avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us let's get you seen by a counsellor, I'll arrange the letter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.41,
      "end_seconds": 307.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.81,
      "end_seconds": 320.78,
      "duration_seconds": 11.97,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. Let's review you in four weeks. Alright, look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.8,
      "end_seconds": 324.8,
